<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6282" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβρ-άσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβρ-άττω</span></b> , aor.
		subj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβράσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.14
				</span></i>
			, <i>boil well, seethe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβράττω κίχλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1197
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα ἀνέβραττεν ὀρνίθεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ra.</u>
					510
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβράττετ᾽, ἐξοπτᾶτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1005
				</span></i>
			, cf. Dsc.l.c.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωήν . . ζέουσάν τε καὶ ἀναβράττουσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					86
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>throw up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐν τοῖς λίκνοις ἀναβραττόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					368b29
				</span></i>
			; esp. of the sea, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμη
			ἀναβρασθεῖσα</span> spray <i>dashed up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.566
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				10.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>jump,</i> of chariot, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Na.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>.</div>
